        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "In-young, a high school student who is alone due to her parents' sudden death, is forced out because of her overdue rent and stays hidden in the Korean Dance Art Troupe where she belongs. In-young, who is still living bravely and brightly despite the sad situation, is caught by the director of the art troupe who is known for being rough, and the director who could not put In-young in the art troupe eventually begins to live with her.",
          "runtime": 102,
          "tagline": "It's okay to be okay.",
          "title": "It's Okay!"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "电影讲述高中生仁英（李来饰）因交通事故失去了母亲。对于独自留下的她来说，虽然世界相当恐怖，但是这个少女比想象中要坚强、开朗、朝气蓬勃。口才狂，韧劲大，无论放到哪里，都有生存下来的气势。跳韩国舞蹈的仁英因为拖欠的房租被赶出家门后，躲在自己所属的艺术团里生活，被以严谨著称的艺术团导演雪娥（陈瑞妍饰）发现，两人慢慢变亲近。 另外，仁英和亲近的社区药剂师（孙锡久饰）也像朋友一样相处。",
          "runtime": 102,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "没事，没事，没事！"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
